{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zf88A4o0kp1795413794.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產信德中心分行副分區營業經理吳炳朝表示，分行新近促成西半山樂賢閣買賣成交，單位為中層B室，實用面積684平方呎，採2房1套間隔，向北，享海景，景觀開揚。單位最終連車位以1,222萬元成交，折合實用呎價17,865元。</p><p><br/>吳炳朝表示，新買家為用家，心儀上址位處傳統半山地段，景觀開揚且附設車位，遂決定入市自用。據了解，原業主於2014年以1,130萬元連車位購入，持貨12年，是次轉手賬面獲利92萬元，單位升值8%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:23:55.110259+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T10:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T23:17:38.508476+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T11:17:15.517842+00:00","content_hash":"98a5b7d7a2abd0bb76932893b658e74aade0ade9bdfa38cbd5cfb3a0f10e5f86","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}